r quick completion, as I can form a chow B2-B3-B4 and wait for B6 to complete B4-B5-B6. The F2 pair as both Prevailing and Seat Wind is too valuable to break. W3(x2) and W6(x2) pairs have more potential value than the isolated W7. Discarding W7 maintains maximum flexibility while removing a dead tile.\n\nAnswer: Play W7"}
