al to form melds given my current hand structure. My strongest potential lies in the Dots suit (B2-B3-B4-B4-B5) which can form consecutive chows. Discarding J2 maintains maximum flexibility for my hand development while removing a tile with no current utility.\n\nAnswer: Play J2"}
